## Including Adviser Fee

As we have agreed to be remunerated via the policy (initial and ongoing), our calculations showed that the Aviva plan is 4.24% more expensive than your current plans. This means that your proposed plan will need to outperform your current plan by £4,672 in the first year (in monetary terms).

