            "sectionHeading": "My Recommendation",
            "quote": "I would recommend you withdraw the full amount of this pension under the small pots rules and put the money into your savings account."
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "I do not recommend that you consolidate into this plan as the funds do not meet your risk profile; Currently, Scottish Widows does not offer a single multi-asset fund that aligns with your risk rating of 5.",
