      {
        "text": "Pensions are currently outside of your estate for IHT purposes, however from 6 April 2027, most unused defined contribution pensions and death benefits (such as drawdown funds and uncrystallised pots) will be included in your taxable estate for IHT. Exceptions include pensions paid to a surviving spouse or civil partner, dependents\u0027 scheme pensions, and death-in-service benefits.",
        "topic": "IHTChangeApril2027",
        "isClientSpecific": true,
        "provenance": {
          "assertionStatus": "Stated",
          "documentId": "Suitability Report Test 1.pdf",
          "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice",
          "pageNumbers": [
